WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.667
Infinitely many closed geodesics, everywhere.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.023
Closed geodesics on a lumpy sphere. The hard part:

3
00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:08.883
telling a new one from an old one traversed again and again.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.824
Claimed: on every sphere and every closed three manifold, infinitely many.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.098
Not in Lean.
